<title>USA: Peoples Heritage completes self tender.</title>
<headline>Peoples Heritage completes self tender.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Maine 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peoples Heritage Financial Group Inc said Tuesday that its self tender offer has been completed and that it expects to purchase about 9.9 percent of the company's outstanding stock.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to purchase 2,500,000 shares of common stock, or about 72 percent of the shares tendered in the offer at $24 per share.</p>
<p>The 2,500,000 shares represent about 9.9 percent of the company's outstanding common stock.</p>
